### Get all salaries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/salaries
Accept: application/json

###
### Search salaries with filters and pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/salaries/search?empId=1&month=2026-05&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###
### Batch generate monthly salaries
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/salaries/generate?month=2026-05
Accept: application/json

###
### Create salary
### Change empId/salaryMonth combination before re-running to avoid unique constraint conflicts.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/salaries
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "empId": 1,
  "salaryMonth": "2026-05",
  "bonus": 300.00,
  "deduction": 100.00
}

###
### Update salary
### Replace 1 with the actual salaryId returned by GET/POST.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/salaries/4
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "empId": 1,
  "salaryMonth": "2026-05",
  "bonus": 500.00,
  "deduction": 120.00
}

###
### Delete salary
### Replace 1 with the actual salaryId you want to delete.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/salaries/4
Accept: application/json

###
### Export monthly salaries CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/export/salaries.csv?month=2026-05
Accept: text/csv
